              "tab_title": "Can I just run YouTube ads myself?",
              "tab_content": "Yes, you can. But most business owners burn \u20b950K-1,00,000 on testing before figuring out what works. We have data from 30+ campaigns and can usually get to profitable in 2-4 weeks vs 2-4 months of solo testing.",
              "element_id": "faq1"
            },
            {
              "tab_title": "Do I need a professional video?",
              "tab_content": "No. We've gotten \u20b90.03 CPV from iPhone footage. The video just needs to be vertical, well-lit, and the first 3 seconds must hook the viewer. We'll direct your iPhone shoot for free \u2014 we send you a shot list, you film, we edit.",
              "element_id": "faq2"
            },
            {
              "tab_title": "How long until I get leads?",
              "tab_content": "You can get leads in week 1. Whether they're <em>good</em> leads depends on your offer and sales process. We optimize for <em>qualified</em> leads, not just any lead. Our healthcare clients get patient leads at \u20b9150-400 each that book consultations.",
              "element_id": "faq3"
            },
            {
              "tab_title": "What about YouTube Shorts?",
              "tab_content": "Yes, we include Shorts in every strategy. Shorts get even cheaper CPVs (\u20b90.01-0.05) and are huge in India. We test both long-form in-stream and Shorts to find what works for your business.",
              "element_id": "faq4"
            },
            {
              "tab_title": "What's the minimum ad budget?",
              "tab_content": "\u20b930,000/month is the minimum for meaningful testing. Below that, you don't have enough data to optimize. We also recommend 3-month minimum commitment \u2014 the algorithm needs 2-4 weeks to learn your audience. We don't run campaigns under \u20b930K budget.",
              "element_id": "faq5"
            }
